Rule 3 (reject unsupported non-numeric dtypes: string or dtype objects)
{v_1: tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 11 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 12 then false
>>
Rule 4 (x must be a numeric tensor (int or float))
{v_1 : tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 5 (boolean, complex, string, and dtype-object tensors are not supported)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 11 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 12
>>
Rule 6 (all dimensions of x must be non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 7 (for unsigned integer input, values are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 5 then min(v_1) ≥ 0
